        <mxCell id="mllm_panel" value="&lt;b&gt;Deskripsi Activity Diagram: Manage LLM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Aktor:&lt;/b&gt; Admin&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tujuan:&lt;/b&gt; Mengelola provider LLM beserta modelnya (khusus admin).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Alur Utama:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Admin membuka halaman kelola Provider LLM.&lt;br&gt;2. Sistem mengautentikasi dan memeriksa role harus admin.&lt;br&gt;3. Sistem menampilkan daftar provider &amp; model.&lt;br&gt;4. Admin memilih aksi: (a) Tambah/ubah provider (nama, base URL, API key): sistem mengenkripsi API key lalu menyimpan; (b) Kelola model (tambah/ubah/hapus): sistem menyimpan perubahan; (c) Hapus provider: sistem menghapus provider &amp; modelnya; (d) Uji koneksi (Test): sistem memanggil provider dan mengembalikan status.&lt;br&gt;5. Sistem memperbarui dan mengembalikan daftar provider; admin melihat daftar terbaru.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Alur Alternatif / Pengecualian:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- 2a. Role bukan admin: sistem mengembalikan error 403.&lt;br&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FCFCFC;strokeColor=#90A4AE;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="50" width="440" height="398" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L_mllm" value="Admin" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=30;horizontal=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;rounded=0;swimlaneFillColor=#E3F2FD;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#1565C0;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="300" height="1020" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="R_mllm" value="Sistem (APANT Backend)" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=30;horizontal=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;rounded=0;swimlaneFillColor=#F1F8E9;fillColor=#F1F8E9;strokeColor=#2E7D32;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="40" width="360" height="1020" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
